// pfodWeb NOTE: GPIO21 tagged "led_low" - confirmed active-low onboard
// USER LED (Seeed Studio wiki, xiao_esp32s3_getting_started: "USER_LED"
// = GPIO21, "The LED will only turn off when the user LED pin ... is
// set to a high level, and it will only turn on when the pin is set to
// a low level."). digital_input dropped to match the XIAO_ESP32S3_Plus
// sibling board's precedent for the same GPIO21/LED_BUILTIN pin.
// No other change from the chip-level default: this is the plain XIAO
// ESP32S3 (no camera - that's the Sense variant; no battery-voltage
// ADC pin - Seeed's own wiki states "we do not have a GPIO configured
// for the battery pin" on this board; no onboard general-purpose user
// button - only Reset/Boot). See boardsDetails notes.txt for full
// research trail.
